  "name": "hotosm_mng_populated_places",
  "notes": "Settlements and residential areas from OSM. Includes named cities, towns, villages, suburbs, and residential land (`place=*` and `landuse=residential`). Useful for demographic context, settlement-level targeting, and population analysis.\n\nOpenStreetMap is a free, collaborative world map built by volunteers. Completeness varies by region: urban areas are usually well-mapped, remote areas may be incomplete. Cross-check critical decisions with local field knowledge.\n\n- Source: [OpenStreetMap](https://www.openstreetmap.org)\n- OSM tags: [Key:place](https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:place), [Key:landuse](https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:landuse)\n- Part of many  [exports grid on HDX](https://data.humdata.org/organization/hot) by the [HOT](https://www.hotosm.org/en/)\n",
